{"applicability_conditions":"适用于各相 j = {Γ, B/TM, FM, RA, DIM}；位错密度 ρ_j 随真应变的变化由 Mecking-Kocks 模型（式 16）计算。","identity":{"block_id":"b0096","equation_id":"equation_015","equation_number":"15","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\sigma_ {j} ^ {\\text { dis }} = \\alpha_ {j} M _ {j} G _ {j} b _ {j} \\sqrt {\\rho_ {j}}\\tag{15}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1016_j.cja.2025.103802"},"latex":"\\sigma_{j}^{\\text{dis}} = \\alpha_{j} M_{j} G_{j} b_{j} \\sqrt{\\rho_{j}}","purpose":"计算各相 j 的位错强化应力贡献，即由位错密度引起的强化量。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"j 相的位错强化应力贡献","symbol":"\\sigma_{j}^{\\text{dis}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"相索引，j = {Γ, B/TM, FM, RA, DIM}","symbol":"j","unit":null,"value":"Γ, B/TM, FM, RA, DIM"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"常数（位错强化系数）","symbol":"\\alpha_{j}","unit":null,"value":"α_BCC = 0.38; α_FCC = 0.35"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Taylor 因子（通过 EBSD 分析获得）","symbol":"M_{j}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"剪切模量","symbol":"G_{j}","unit":"GPa","value":"G_F = 66.0 GPa; G_B/TM, FM, DIM = 81.6 GPa; G_RA = 72.0 GPa"},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"柏氏矢量模量（柏氏矢量大小）","symbol":"b_{j}","unit":"nm","value":"b_BCC = 0.248 nm; b_FCC = 0.250 nm"},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错密度","symbol":"\\rho_{j}","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["位错密度 ρ_j 随真应变的变化由 Mecking-Kocks 模型（式 16）计算。"]}